          "title": "本田电动平衡车",
          "content": "<p>日本摩托车厂商本田公司，发布了一个概念性的单轮电动平衡车的设计，令人耳目一新。这种车比摩托车成本更低、更节省空间。</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.beekka.com/blogimg/asset/202107/bg2021072410.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" /></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.beekka.com/blogimg/asset/202107/bg2021072411.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" /></p>\n<p>令人比较好奇的是，停放的时候，它怎么保持平衡呢。</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.beekka.com/blogimg/asset/202107/bg2021072412.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" /></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.beekka.com/blogimg/asset/202107/bg2021072413.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" /></p>",
